---
workflowId: {{q .ID}}
displayName: {{q .DisplayName}}
description: {{q .Description}}
version: {{if .Version}}{{q .Version}}{{else}}1.0.0{{end}}
entrypoint: {{q .Entrypoint}}
broker:
  input_schema: {{.InputSchema}}
  egress:
    output: "result.json"
    max_bytes: {{.MaxBytes}}
    schema: {{.EgressSchema}}
{{- if .Proposes}}
  proposes:
{{- range .Proposes}}
    - action: {{q .Action}}
      tool: {{q .Tool}}
      output: {{q .Output}}
      args_schema: {{.ArgsSchema}}
{{- if .Standing}}
      standing: {{.Standing}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .Schedule}}
  schedule: {{.Schedule}}
{{- end}}
steps:
{{- range .Steps}}
  {{.Name}}:
    type: agent
    role: {{q .Role}}
    on_success: {{.Next}}
{{- if .RequireOutputGlob}}
    require_output_glob: {{q .RequireOutputGlob}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
terminals:
  done:
    status: COMPLETED
---

# {{.DisplayName}}

Rendered by the agent admin verbs for namespace {{.Namespace}}.

## Prompts
{{range .Steps}}
### {{.Name}}

{{.Instructions}}
{{if not .First}}
Earlier steps' files are in `artifacts/out/`.
{{end}}
{{- if .Last}}
Write `artifacts/out/result.json` with exactly the approved egress shape.
{{- if $.Proposes}}
To propose a change, also write a file with exactly this shape, its args
matching the action's schema; each one waits for the user's approval:
{{- range $.Proposes}}
- {{.Action}}: `artifacts/out/{{.Output}}` containing `{"action": "{{.Action}}", "args": { ... }}`
{{- end}}
{{.Closing}}
{{- else}} {{.Closing}}
{{- end}}
{{else}}
Write what the next step needs to `artifacts/out/{{.Name}}.md`. Only files
under `artifacts/out/` reach later steps; anything you write elsewhere is
discarded when this step ends.
Do not write `artifacts/out/result.json`: that name is the workflow's answer
and only its last step writes it.
{{end}}{{end}}
